<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-025" chapter-id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches" source-id="s-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches-ws12757141">
  <p id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">少子<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p001:m0002" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_A">仲度</persName>嗣，位驃騎從事中郎。兄弟並有才用，皆早卒。<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p001:m0025" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_A">仲度</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p001:m0028" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AA">撝</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p002:m0000" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AAA">沆</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p002:m0002" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AAA">茂瀣</persName>，幼聰敏，五歲時，父<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p002:m0014" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AA">撝</persName>于屏風抄古詩，<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p002:m0022" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AAA">沆</persName>請教讀一遍，便能諷誦。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0000" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_ABB">溉</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0002" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_ABB">茂灌</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0005" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AA">撝</persName>弟子也。父<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0011" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AB">坦</persName>，齊中書郎。<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0018" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_ABB">溉</persName>少孤貧，與兄<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0025" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_ABA">沼</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0027" ref="4mr_j4p_k5h">洽</persName>俱知名，起家王國左常侍。</p>
</text>
